      en: "Centuries after the Old Ones' technological civilization fell, Earth has gone wild again: nature has reclaimed the ruins, and primitive tribes live alongside towering animal-like machines. Aloy, an outcast of the Nora, grows into a huntress caught between wonder and menace, seeking the truth about her birth and the world's end."
